flowchart TD
    %% rank: F 3
    A["Input assets • images, masks, meshes"]:::slate
    B["Model selection • pinned checkpoint and hash"]:::purple
    C["Native generation nodes • SF3D, TRELLIS v1, Hunyuan3D, TripoSG"]:::amber
    D["Native geometry and splat nodes • mesh ops, 3DGS optimize"]:::amber
    F["Reviewed external adapter • SAM 3D, TRELLIS.2, UniRig, MeshAnything"]:::rose
