    G["Representation conversion • mesh or splat PLY, recorded"]:::amber
    H["Export • GLB, OBJ, PLY"]:::amber
    I["Validation • validate_asset.py per output"]:::green
    J["Reusable workflow JSON • versions, seeds, paths"]:::slate
    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> D
    B -.->|files out| F
    D --> E
    F -.->|GLB, OBJ, FBX back| G
    E --> G
    G --> H
    H --> I
    I -->|pass| J
